          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observations of the straight and silent passage of a luminous phenomenon in the sky: atmospheric reentry of a stage of the Soyuz launcher SL-4 R/B.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "bca5b6c7eb4129a53685c4079afdeefa271cc750f671c952a2206d61eefbe7a1"
